"the number of images you have browsed to gets below the number of images "
"that can be shown in a single view. The alternative is to continue showing "
"the browser until you press <i>Show Images</i>."
"<p>"
"<p>With this option on, you can choose to see the browser by pressing "
"ctrl+mouse button."
"<br>With this option off, you can choose to see the images by pressing "
"ctrl+mouse button.</p></qt>"
